  "scope": "Canonical matrix-block comprehensions, current host Value geometry, live-shaped control results, named-output kind context and verified resident tail transitions.",
  "changes": [
    "Unannotated Matrix-valued bracket yields concatenate one horizontal block level; explicit nested element schemas retain nested values.",
    "Actual admitted block geometry governs row authority, summed widths, zero axes and final cardinality constraints; skipped yields do not determine shape.",
    "Canonical host inputs retain current Turn dimensions while fixed and Activation dimensions remain authoritative. Batch validation precedes writes.",
    "Selected Matrix results and typed Tuple, Record, Option and Enum wrappers retain current immutable snapshot geometry through direct and resumed control publication.",
    "Declared named function outputs provide lexical expected kinds for their direct body definitions; body annotations and final output conformance retain their authority.",
    "Only structurally proven terminal calls to the same control target use a bounded-frame loop; exact logical yield identity distinguishes empty dense locals. Genuine non-tail recursion retains its frame limit.",
    "Nine maintained pure operations without a closed evaluator are explicitly classified as deferred; no compile-time folding support is claimed for them."
  ],
